{
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.Line2631": "\n"
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.Line2638": " [b:("
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.NtheDarkIllusionAround": "\nThe dark illusion around [themonster] finally dissipates, leaving [monster.him] no longer fearful as [monster.he] regains confidence."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.NtheGlowAround": "\nThe glow around [themonster]'s "
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.NtheGolemShimmeringShield": "\nThe golem's shimmering shield dissipates - he can be attacked again!"
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.NtheMagicalShellAround": "\nThe magical shell around [themonster] shatters!"
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.NtheRealityAroundFinally": "\nThe reality around [themonster] finally snaps back in place as [monster.his] illusion spell fades."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.NtheTalismanSuccessfullyRemoves": "\nThe talisman successfully removes the creature's spell, restoring your existence!"
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.NyouFeelBitWeaker": "\nYou feel a bit weaker as your strength-enhancing spell wears off."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.NyouFeelBitWeakerYour": "\nYou feel a bit weaker as your strength-enhancing spell wears off."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.TheGolemDoesnSeem": "[pg-]The Golem doesn't seem to care about the flames."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.TwirlingLikeTopYou": " Twirling like a top, you bat your opponent with your tail."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.YouGatherEnergyYour": "You gather energy in your Talisman and unleash the spell contained within. A green aura washes over you and your wounds begin to close quickly. By the time the aura fully fades, you feel much better. "
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.YouGatherEnergyYourTalisman": "You gather energy in your Talisman and unleash the spell contained within. A wave of burning flames gathers around [themonster], slowly burning [monster.him]."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.YouGatherEnergyYourTalismanAnd": "You gather energy in your Talisman and unleash the spell contained within. A pink aura washes all over you and as soon as the aura fades, you feel much less horny."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.YouGatherEnergyYourTalismanAndUnleash": "You gather energy in your Talisman and unleash the spell contained within. A barrier of light engulfs you, before turning completely transparent. Your defense has been increased.[pg]"
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.YouRollForwardOnto": "You roll forward onto your obscene belly, flattening it slightly under the weight of the rest of your body, then hold your royal scepter up into the air in front of you. Three long, slimy tendrils snake their way out of your quivering snatch and grab hold of the scepter, bringing it around to your back end to tease you with the pregnant looking gemstone at the scepter's end. As the tentacles roll the gemstone up and down the outer lips of your pussy, you can feel your exhaustion slowly leaking out of you. In response, the gemstone glows with soft purple energy, the faces reflected in its facets seeming to animate with lustful vigor. A corona of the violet lust expands outward, washing your [skin] with the feeling of pre-orgasm. Feeling rejuvenated, you hold one arm out and your tentacles deposit the staff gingerly into your outstretched palm. Back in command, you roll back into the closest approximation your replete body can manage of a combative stance."
  "Combat.Arian.Dispel.YourSpellOverpowersThe": " [b:Your spell overpowers the Inquisitor's], and its magical energy is absorbed into yours, for an extremely effective attack!"
  "Combat.Arian.Heal.YouTryReadySpecial": "You try to ready a special ability, but wind up stumbling dizzily instead. [b:Your ability to use magical special attacks was sealed, and now you've wasted a chance to attack!][pg]"
  "Combat.Arian.Immolate.TheGolemDoesnSeem": "[pg-]The Golem doesn't seem to care about the flames."
  "Combat.Arian.Immolate.YouRoarAndUnleash": "You roar and unleash your savage fury before charging forward, forgetting about defense in order to destroy your foe![pg]"
  "Combat.Arian.LustReduce.YouGatherEnergyYour": "You gather energy in your Talisman and unleash the spell contained within. A pink aura washes all over you and as soon as the aura fades, you feel much less horny."
  "Combat.Arian.ShieldingSpell.BarrierOfLight": "You gather energy in your Talisman and unleash the spell contained within. A barrier of light engulfs you, before turning completely transparent. Your defense has been increased.[pg]"
}
